     3	 * proceed. Amends spec §3.3 (final): `Command.materialize_stage` drops
     4	 * `stage_contract` (the storage layer already holds the compiled definition
     5	 * and can look the contract up by `stage_key`); `materialize_unit` /
     6	 * `revise_unit` gain `stage_key` and `inputs` — the named per-unit input map
     7	 * — because `apply` must resolve slot bindings by input name, and
     8	 * `input_snapshot` alone (its flattened envelopes) cannot answer "what is
     9	 * input 'brief'".
